      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "not sure it's 100% related, but in desktop mode, if you turn on the stream camera's spout stream and exit the camera menu (with spout still working), you can see the lens in the center of your screen (both semi-transparent and opaque)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "68bb009096015591be86fca4",
      "author": {
        "_id": "64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2",
        "alias": "Papaya Python",
        "aliasID": "65c26df7ed6eefce4c5bafd9",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/0cc52fe8eefdb02dd977f85433f98936.png",
        "created": "2023-06-12T15:51:49.320Z",
